    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cYou\u2019re the one holding the gun\u2026 But the boss? He rides on your shoulder.\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.poster.avif?t=1753339790\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.webm?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.mp4?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore 14 Unique Maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From eerie forests to abandoned villages, <i>DecayZ Origin</i> features <strong>14 handcrafted maps</strong>, each offering its own atmosphere, challenges, and hidden secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6+ Hours of Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a gripping survival experience with <strong>over 6 hours of content</strong>, combining exploration, intense combat, puzzle-solving, and a unique bond with your loyal cat companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>New Game+</strong> to replay the story with your <strong>upgraded gear carried over</strong>, offering new challenges and greater rewards. <br>  <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.poster.avif?t=1753339790\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.webm?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.mp4?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Game Feature</strong> <br> <br><strong>Story Puzzles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve environment-based puzzles integrated into the main storyline. These challenges test your logic and observation, unlocking new areas and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Weapon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your gear to increase damage, improve clip size, and unlock special abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft Ammo and Health</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to craft various types of ammunition and health items essential for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a detailed map to track objectives, mark locations, and explore key areas. The map updates as you discover new zones, making navigation intuitive and strategic. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/b5bd4edbad3b827abe1a555fc91ad0d4.avif?t=1753339790\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quest Guide Line</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow a clear quest guide system that helps you stay on track with main objectives. Waypoints and journal entries keep you informed of your progress and goals. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prologue</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        In the remote mountains of Thailand, a top-secret government laboratory becomes ground zero for a deadly virus that spreads with the ferocity of a wildfire. As the virus ravages the surrounding villages, the government imposes martial law, but it's too late. The virus claims thousands of lives in just one week, leaving no hope for a cure or vaccine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the infected slowly die and rise again as mutations, the government keeps their disappearance under wraps, and the project is abandoned, forgotten, and left to the virus's mercy.<br><br>However, 20 years later, the virus has spread beyond the isolated mountains, and the world is gripped in a pandemic that leaves no hope. The government, desperate for a cure, seeks foreign aid and dispatches a first expedition team to contain the outbreak, but they disappear without a trace. The second expedition team is sent in to find the source of the virus. However, as the team ventures back into the mountains, they realize that the virus has evolved, adapted, and become far more terrifying than anyone ever imagined. What they find there will test their will to survive and may mean the end of humanity as we know it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cYou\u2019re the one holding the gun\u2026 But the boss? He rides on your shoulder.\u201d<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.poster.avif?t=1753339790\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.webm?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/5317ef757e3db385f51b346acc70c45a.mp4?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore 14 Unique Maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From eerie forests to abandoned villages, <i>DecayZ Origin</i> features <strong>14 handcrafted maps</strong>, each offering its own atmosphere, challenges, and hidden secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6+ Hours of Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a gripping survival experience with <strong>over 6 hours of content</strong>, combining exploration, intense combat, puzzle-solving, and a unique bond with your loyal cat companion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>New Game+</strong> to replay the story with your <strong>upgraded gear carried over</strong>, offering new challenges and greater rewards. <br>  <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.poster.avif?t=1753339790\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.webm?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/0d4c9bd125ce9ec0eda34e092af33aac.mp4?t=1753339790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>Game Feature</strong> <br> <br><strong>Story Puzzles</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve environment-based puzzles integrated into the main storyline. These challenges test your logic and observation, unlocking new areas and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade Weapon</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your gear to increase damage, improve clip size, and unlock special abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft Ammo and Health</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to craft various types of ammunition and health items essential for survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a detailed map to track objectives, mark locations, and explore key areas. The map updates as you discover new zones, making navigation intuitive and strategic. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984800/extras/b5bd4edbad3b827abe1a555fc91ad0d4.avif?t=1753339790\" data-has-big /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quest Guide Line</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow a clear quest guide system that helps you stay on track with main objectives. Waypoints and journal entries keep you informed of your progress and goals. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prologue</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        In the remote mountains of Thailand, a top-secret government laboratory becomes ground zero for a deadly virus that spreads with the ferocity of a wildfire. As the virus ravages the surrounding villages, the government imposes martial law, but it's too late. The virus claims thousands of lives in just one week, leaving no hope for a cure or vaccine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the infected slowly die and rise again as mutations, the government keeps their disappearance under wraps, and the project is abandoned, forgotten, and left to the virus's mercy.<br><br>However, 20 years later, the virus has spread beyond the isolated mountains, and the world is gripped in a pandemic that leaves no hope. The government, desperate for a cure, seeks foreign aid and dispatches a first expedition team to contain the outbreak, but they disappear without a trace. The second expedition team is sent in to find the source of the virus. However, as the team ventures back into the mountains, they realize that the virus has evolved, adapted, and become far more terrifying than anyone ever imagined. What they find there will test their will to survive and may mean the end of humanity as we know it.</p>",
